    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University (AKU) will host its 3rd Under-19 Inter School/Collegiate Boys Basketball and Girls Throwball tournaments from Friday, February 11, 2005 onwards with an opening ceremony at 3:00 PM at AKU Sports and Rehabilitation Centre. Dr David Taylor, Acting Provost, AKU, will be the chief guest.",
